# Authentication

<!-- User regester -->

## To Register user use this link

http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
register user with the following data

```json
{
  "username": "Enter your username",
  "email": "Enter your email",
  "password": "Enter your password"
}
```

## after register get the eamil for veryfication or can ues the token for veryfication

## to verify email use this link

http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-email

with the following data

```
{token}

```

<!--End of user regester -->

<!-- User login -->

## To login user use this link 💧

http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Login user with the following data

```json
{
  "email": "Enter your Email",
  "password": "Enter your password"
}
```

after Login session will start and you can access the protect route with the token

## Forgot password

to reset password use this link
http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
with the following data

```json
{
  "email": "Enter your email"
}
```

after submit the email you will get the reset password link in your email inbox

## verify the otp

http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp/:email
with the following data

```json
{
  "otp": "Enter the otp you received in your email"
}
```

## Confirm password

to reset password use this link
http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/confirm-password/:email
with the following data

```json
{
  "newpassword": "Enter your new password",
  "confirmpassword": "Enter your new password"
}
```

## Logout user

to logout user use this link
http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout

pass the header authorization with the token
token will the access token that you received after login or register

```json
{
  "Authorization": "Bearer {token}"
}
```
